; ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
; injections.scm — language injections
;
; DBC strings are plain text (units like "rpm", labels like "Idle", comment
; bodies). There are no embedded expression languages in DBC, so no injections
; are required. This file exists so Zed won't fall back to any other grammar
; for embedded ranges.
; ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
